<img src="g100130ex99_2s9g1.jpg" alt="Slide 9" title="Slide 9" ></p> <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:1pt;line-height:0pt;color:#FFFFFF;"><font style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:1pt;"> Transaction overview Transaction
consideration $231 per share in cash consideration to Silicon Labs&#8217; shareholders Implied enterprise value: $7.5 billion Funding and financials Combination of balance sheet cash and financing in the investment grade capital markets Accretive to
Texas Instruments&#8217; EPS1 in first full year post-close $450 million of annual manufacturing and operational synergies within three years of close Capital allocation Committed to maintaining current investment grade rating Committed to capital
return strategy to return 100% of free cash flow over time via dividends and share repurchases Timing and approvals Closing anticipated in first half of 2027 Subject to approval of Silicon Labs&#8217; shareholders Subject to the satisfaction of
customary closing conditions, including required regulatory approvals Company estimates 1 Excluding transaction-related costs</font></p>
